* 3D drop solver: workpiece 2 already resting on die 3 (die 1 lifted 10). The first contact detection (mode 1 accepts signed distance <= 0) finds the bottom nodes, no initial drop, equilibrium at once. Expect no motion of object 2 (if the touching nodes are not accepted the initial drop moves it by at most about -0.001 in z) and 'Object 2 has been dropped successfully.'
KFREAD 0
UPSET_Brick.KEY
OBJPOS 1 1 0 0 10
OBJPOS 2 7 0.002 0 0 -1 0 0 0 0
KFWRIT
OUT.KEY
